                                "example_id": "fa0bb847-8217-4634-b0c6-25191c8fe80c",
                                "sense_id": "6e1d5215-9c33-3eda-8071-76ec67add99f",
                                "text": "Nepantla is indeed gestational and fetiferous, but not of some postliminal existence, for there is no postliminal existence available."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e938c237-2b1a-4c8c-94ae-dda10918bbd5",
                                "sense_id": "6e1d5215-9c33-3eda-8071-76ec67add99f",
                                "text": "[…]all the treasury of those ideal signatures, which […] became existent in the matrix or womb of that generative and faetiferous word, from whence sprung up the wonderful, numerous and various seminal natures[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78054682-6df2-4abb-af9e-556a5dc51f83",
                                "sense_id": "6e1d5215-9c33-3eda-8071-76ec67add99f",
                                "text": "Fruit somewhat globose, usually fetiferous, with a sweet pulp."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9444738c-6ad1-4db5-acec-a1786bd20a9e",
                                "sense_id": "6e1d5215-9c33-3eda-8071-76ec67add99f",
                                "text": "Fetiferous of gems which sparkle more / Than fairy lights in eye of queen […]"
                            },
                            {
